## Pool Configuration (db.js)

| Setting | Value | Purpose |
|---------|-------|---------|
| `max` | 20 | Max concurrent client connections |
| `idleTimeoutMillis` | 30000 | Close idle connections after 30 seconds |
| `connectionTimeoutMillis` | 2000 | Fail after 2s if unable to establish connection |
| `idleTimeoutMillis` | configurable via `PG_IDLE_TIMEOUT` env var |
| `connectionTimeoutMillis` | configurable via `PG_CONNECTION_TIMEOUT` env var |

